cpc/post/Dfb3noaEsD8","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Walkman 的復古耳機換上 USB-C！Sony MDR-3R 保留輕巧頭帶與藍、橙耳墊風格，加入麥克風與線控，美國官網標價 US$59.99。懷舊外型接上現代裝置，還有哪些細節更新？台灣售價與上市資訊仍待確認。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:33:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfbmZPKEgSt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfbmZPKEgSt","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"做影片不用買超貴顯卡！超簡單！教你怎麼讓 AI Agent 幫你免費生圖、做影片","timestamp":"2026-11-07T07:02:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfbjWyXku4Z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfbjWyXku4Z","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-07T06:36:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfbjSC1Ejur","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfbjSC1Ejur","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Meta 想讓你用聊天打造自己的小工具！Muse 新增 Spaces，把想法變成互動空間，還能用自然語言修改功能與介面。官方示範遊戲、活動追蹤器與家庭控制面板，和一般獨立 App 有什麼不同？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-07T06:35:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":240,"replies":29,"reposts":19,"shares":170},"score":355,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"陪客戶做夢(O)\n陪客戶做自動化(X)\n\n最近對於 AI 模型的進步突然有感而發\n五個月前，同一個客戶需求\n用當時的 opus 只能跑出 6x% 的成功率\n\n而現在只需要 sonnet 5.5 \n就能跑出 99% 以上的成功率\n\n這個場景是客戶流程的一大痛點\n他們會收到一份超多頁的 pdf\n以往都需要人工逐頁處理跟登打\n\n現在因為他們導入了新的 ERP 系統\n系統本身也能很簡單的就跟 AI 做串接\n又享受到 AI 模型的進步\n\n只需要在系統裡面做一部：上傳\n接著就放手交給 AI + 系統處理\n一個 PDF → 一百多筆資料 → 全自動出現在系統\n同仁只需要確認那些 AI 回報信心程度較低的項目就好\n\n一個小時的工作只剩下不到幾分鐘！\n如果你想知道這是哪套 ERP 系統 ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"歡迎洽詢 Odoo ERP \n找 @lupus_rr 評估自己的公司是否適合換成 Odoo\n\n享受簡單易用、又能根據需求客製化的 ERP 系統","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfWiscZn__A","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfWiscZn__A","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"ChatGPT Images 2.6 is quite interesting. \nIt can produce very accurate SVGs, and the GIF effect is also quite good. \nHowever, making GIFs should be quite expensive.","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:54:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":4},"score":35,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":22,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":24},"score":29,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T17:38:43+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}